  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──あ、あの……プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "まだ少し先のことなんですけれど──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと、ライブが終わった次の日に打ち上げも兼ねて\r\nお花見しようってことになって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "よかったらプロデューサーさんも誘えたらって\r\n灯織ちゃんとめぐるちゃんと考えていて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あの、どうでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、いいなぁ、打ち上げにお花見かぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──でも、ライブの後はしばらく予定が詰まっててな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……そうなんですね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、せっかく誘ってくれたのに申し訳ない\r\n今回は真乃たちで楽しんできてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010150"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、あの……そうしたら私、\r\nお花見の写真、いっぱい撮ってきます……っ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんにも、\r\n桜の花を見ていただけるように……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010170"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……その、桜は上手に撮れたことがないので……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "写真だと、あんまりきれいじゃないかも\r\nしれないですけれど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、ありがとう真乃",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "写真と一緒にお花見の思い出話も聞けたら嬉しいな\r\nどうだろう……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──お花見の日は、何するか決めてるのか？\r\nお弁当を持ちよったりとか、出店を回るとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああいや、食べ物以外にも決めることはあるだろうけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ふふ、そうですね、\r\n食べ物もそうですし他にもいろいろ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みんなと話しているだけで楽しくて……\r\n詳しくは決めきれていないんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんだったら\r\nお花見では何が一番楽しみですか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010230"
  },
  {
    "select": "楽しくおしゃべり\r\nすることかな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "やっぱり\r\n食べることかな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "風景を\r\n楽しむことかな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010240,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "わ、おしゃべりですか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、みんなで集まって、くだらないこととか\r\n取り留めのない話とかしてたら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "つい時間が過ぎるのも忘れちゃったりしてさ\r\n晴れた空の下で、なんだか贅沢な時間だ──って思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……\r\nそれに、とっても気持ちよさそうです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……そよ風があったかくて、\r\nみんなの笑い声も響いて",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ふふ、楽しい声につられて\r\n鳥さんも遊びに来てくれるかもしれません……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010270"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもより奮発して食べ物をたくさん……\r\n飲み物もお菓子も持ちよって、満腹になるまで食べたりさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ふふ、食べ物がたくさんなのも\r\nにぎやかで楽しそうです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010280"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010290,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お弁当は灯織ちゃんが作ってくれるって言ってて……\r\n……私は、何を用意しようかな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101301/2001013010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、あったかい飲み物とかどうだろう\r\n前、お花見で飲んだ豚汁がすごい美味くてな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001013010300,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "わぁ……あったかい飲み物……\r\nいいかもしれません……っ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
